              Get up and running with the SciMSPT API in under 5 minutes. 
              This guide walks you through your first API call.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="code-block">
            <div class="code-header">
              <span class="code-lang">Python</span>
              <button class="code-copy" onclick="copyCode(this)">Copy</button>
            </div>
            <pre class="code-content"><span class="keyword">from</span> scimspt <span class="keyword">import</span> SciMSPTClient

<span class="comment"># Initialize client with your API key</span>
client = SciMSPTClient(
    api_key=<span class="string">"scimspt_live_sk_your_key_here"</span>
)

<span class="comment"># Analyze a research paper</span>
result = client.analyze_paper(
    paper_id=<span class="string">"arxiv:2401.12345"</span>,
    include_startups=<span class="keyword">True</span>,
    depth=<span class="string">"comprehensive"</span>
)

<span class="comment"># Access results</span>
<span class="function">print</span>(<span class="string">f"Analysis Score: {result.confidence}"</span>)
<span class="function">print</span>(<span class="string">f"Related Startups: {len(result.startups)}"</span>)</pre>
          </div>
          
          <div class="endpoint-grid">
            <div class="endpoint-card">
              <span class="endpoint-method post">POST</span>
